{"name": "Cubic Cosmos", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cubic Cosmos combines roguelike deck building with fast-paced tower defense gameplay. Build an unstoppable army of pawns, chain together massive combos, and enjoy endless possibilities!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Mix and Match Countless Exciting Strategies</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create an army of unstoppable pawns and build up their attributes to beat down the strongest of bosses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/21b8770e374fdd91dbefc35653f780f2.poster.avif?t=1784279773\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/21b8770e374fdd91dbefc35653f780f2.webm?t=1784279773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/21b8770e374fdd91dbefc35653f780f2.mp4?t=1784279773\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chain together abilities to unleash awesome combos, take endless turns, and deal massive damage... anything is possible!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Team up pawns to unlock incredible synergies and clear whole battlefields in a single shot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/ea38a81dcab1074310ff477b3a6d2ed7.poster.avif?t=1784279773\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/ea38a81dcab1074310ff477b3a6d2ed7.webm?t=1784279773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/ea38a81dcab1074310ff477b3a6d2ed7.mp4?t=1784279773\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build an Unbeatable Deck</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine cards and Relics to build an unstoppable deck.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clear runs to unlock 12 different heroes across 3 classes with unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With 240+ cards, create lethal combinations that are unique to you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore unique effect combos with 50+ equippable Relics.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tons of random events make each run a new adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/4a312048d5a4702d2c461b031643c4b7.poster.avif?t=1784279773\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/4a312048d5a4702d2c461b031643c4b7.webm?t=1784279773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/4a312048d5a4702d2c461b031643c4b7.mp4?t=1784279773\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Rise to the Challenge in Multiple Game Modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Endless Adventures: With fixed and random boss fights and daily challenges, you'll find new thrills in every run!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scaling Difficulty: Prove yourself in 10+ difficulty levels and emerge stronger than ever.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mastery Mode: Are you a true master of the cosmos? Put your perfectly crafted deck to the test in this high-pressure game mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/9ece4df3769ced70f9b0b24a100d14aa.poster.avif?t=1784279773\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/9ece4df3769ced70f9b0b24a100d14aa.webm?t=1784279773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/9ece4df3769ced70f9b0b24a100d14aa.mp4?t=1784279773\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Share Pawns and Matches With One Click</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Doll Code System: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">11 different Doll types grant incredible buffs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Share your beloved pawns with the world and let them marvel at your strength!</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Match Share: Generate a Battle Code to share your best moments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/674f377e9c1b83eb56374b075e32aa6d.poster.avif?t=1784279773\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/674f377e9c1b83eb56374b075e32aa6d.webm?t=1784279773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/674f377e9c1b83eb56374b075e32aa6d.mp4?t=1784279773\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p></li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "Cubic Cosmos is 